      object Label4: TLabel
        Left = 14
        Top = 6
        Width = 379
        Height = 352
        Caption = 
          'Employees marked '#39'P'#39' already have a pay record for which'#13#10'pay ha' +
          's been calculated and are ready to have a check cut.'#13#10'Employees ' +
          'marked '#39'C'#39' have a pay record for which pay has not'#13#10' yet been ca' +
          'lculated (most likely represents time card hours).'#13#10#13#10'TO PAY OR ' +
          'EDIT ONE EMPLOYEE:  Highlight the employee and'#13#10' click Pay One (' +
          'you do not have to tag the employee).'#13#10#13#10'TO PAY MULTIPLE EMPLOYE' +
          'ES:'#13#10' First, tag the employees to be paid.  To tag an employee:'#13 +
          #10' Highlight the desired employee, then press ENTER.  Or, click'#13#10 +
          ' the highlighted employee a second time.  Or, click the'#13#10' Tag/Un' +
          'tag button.  There are also buttons to tag all listed'#13#10' employee' +
          's, and to tag all employees for a selected division.'#13#10#13#10' Once th' +
          'e employees are tagged, click on one of the Pay All'#13#10' buttons.  ' +
          'You can choose to review/change each employee'#39's'#13#10' pay numbers as' +
          ' pay gets calculated for that employee, or'#13#10' select the No Revie' +
          'w option and the system will calculate pay'#13#10' for all the tagged ' +
          'employees without pausing for review/change'#13#10' between each emplo' +
          'yee.  In either case you can manually edit'#13#10' any employee'#39's pay ' +
          'after the calculation process is complete.'
      end
